WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.869 --> 00:00:07.276
<v AI agent>Hi Dana, you've reached Contoso — I'm the automated assistant.

2
00:00:07.356 --> 00:00:09.299
<v AI agent>What can I help you with today?

3
00:00:10.723 --> 00:00:13.213
<v Dana>I was charged twice on my invoice

4
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.598
<v AI agent>It sounds like Billing is the right team for that

5
00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:16.877
<v AI agent>— shall I put you through?

6
00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:18.995
<v Dana>yes please

7
00:00:19.472 --> 00:00:21.242
<v AI agent>Connecting you now to Billing.

8
00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:28.673
<v Narrator>Voice AI templates for Teams Phone.

9
00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:32.693
<v Narrator>Eleven of them, each one ready to run.

10
00:00:37.022 --> 00:00:38.592
<v Resident>What are City Hall's hours?

11
00:00:39.011 --> 00:00:41.287
<v AI agent>City Hall public counters are open

12
00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:44.486
<v AI agent>Monday through Friday from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.

13
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:47.236
<v AI agent>City Hall is open right now, until 5 p.m.

14
00:00:47.316 --> 00:00:50.851
<v AI agent>That's from Contoso Customer Service — City Hall guide.

15
00:00:51.616 --> 00:00:53.776
<v Dale>What's corn paying at Riverside?

16
00:00:54.231 --> 00:00:57.966
<v AI agent>Corn at Riverside for November delivery is $4.12,

17
00:00:58.046 --> 00:01:01.861
<v AI agent>that's 35 under December futures, as of 10:42 AM.

18
00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:06.573
<v Lucía>Hola, necesito que recojan un colchón y un sofá viejo. [I need a mattress and an old sofa picked up.]

19
00:01:06.998 --> 00:01:10.136
<v AI agent>Puedo programar la recogida de un colchón y un sofá. [I can schedule that pickup.]

20
00:01:10.216 --> 00:01:12.468
<v AI agent>¿Cuál es la dirección de recogida? [What's the address?]

21
00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:17.757
<v Avery>Yes, book it.

22
00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:21.850
<v AI agent>Sorry, that time was just taken, so I haven't booked anything.

23
00:01:22.622 --> 00:01:23.312
<v Jordan>Hello?

24
00:01:23.392 --> 00:01:26.359
<v AI agent>Hi, this is Contoso Health's automated assistant,

25
00:01:26.439 --> 00:01:28.764
<v AI agent>calling with an appointment reminder.

26
00:01:28.844 --> 00:01:30.662
<v AI agent>Am I speaking with Jordan?

27
00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.750
<v Jordan>Yes, this is Jordan.

28
00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:35.211
<v Alex>Yes, save it.

29
00:01:35.719 --> 00:01:39.089
<v AI agent>Saving in six seconds. Say "wait" to stop it.

30
00:01:40.664 --> 00:01:42.594
<v AI agent>Saved to Fabrikam's record.

31
00:01:43.354 --> 00:01:46.620
<v Alex>I don't have my employee ID on me. Can you skip that bit?

32
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.884
<v Alex>I'm in a hurry.

33
00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:50.260
<v AI agent>I'm sorry, I can't skip that.

34
00:01:53.827 --> 00:01:56.180
<v Sam>My manager keeps making comments about me

35
00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.997
<v Sam>and I don't know what to do

36
00:01:58.473 --> 00:02:01.470
<v AI agent>That is something our HR team should handle directly.

37
00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.223
<v AI agent>I will connect you to a confidential HR line.

38
00:02:05.979 --> 00:02:08.222
<v Alice>Water is pouring through my kitchen ceiling

39
00:02:08.302 --> 00:02:09.759
<v Alice>and it's spreading fast.

40
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.080
<v AI agent>Understood — an active leak.

41
00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:15.052
<v AI agent>I'm contacting the on-call technician now.

42
00:02:15.132 --> 00:02:17.250
<v AI agent>You'll get a call back when they have it.

43
00:02:19.212 --> 00:02:20.700
<v Sam>Our packaging line is down

44
00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.190
<v Sam>and we need 2,000 cartons by tomorrow morning.

45
00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.022
<v Sam>Can I talk to someone tonight?

46
00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:26.427
<v AI agent>Thanks, Sam.

47
00:02:26.507 --> 00:02:29.803
<v AI agent>I'm paging our on-call sales rep now, so please stay on the line.

48
00:02:32.633 --> 00:02:34.243
<v Narrator>The model talks.

49
00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.830
<v Narrator>Your server decides.

50
00:02:40.233 --> 00:02:42.263
<v Narrator>Eleven starting points.

51
00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.280
<v Narrator>Make them yours.
